  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こんにちは</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小坂菜緒です</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">約一週間前の話になってしまいますが</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">8</span><span class=\"s2\">月</span><span class=\"s1\">9</span><span class=\"s2\">日に「ミュージックステーション」さんに出演しました！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ドレミソラシドで出演するのは、なんと、</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">回目でした！</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本当に嬉しかったです。ありがとうございます。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4874.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4901.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">カメラに至近距離に近づいてみた系ツーショット</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">新衣装も可愛くて可愛くて大好きです♪♪</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また出演できるように皆で頑張りたいと思います！！！</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.</span><span class=\"s2\">。</span><span class=\"s1\">*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.</span><span class=\"s2\">。</span><span class=\"s1\">*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.</span><span class=\"s2\">。</span><span class=\"s1\">*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.</span><span class=\"s2\">。</span><span class=\"s1\">*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.*:</span><span class=\"s2\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">8</span><span class=\"s2\">月</span><span class=\"s1\">11</span><span class=\"s2\">日</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">「キュン」個別握手会</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">名古屋</span></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">この日に</span><span class=\"s1\">4</span><span class=\"s2\">・</span><span class=\"s1\">5</span><span class=\"s2\">部を欠席させて頂きました。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">会いに来てくださってた皆さん、出ることが出来なくてすみませんでした。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ご心配をおかけしてしまってすみません。。。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">もう全然元気なので大丈夫ですよ</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\">・</span><span class=\"s1\">3</span><span class=\"s2\">部の洋服はこんな感じでした(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5328.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">やっとワンショルに挑戦できた</span><span class=\"s1\">~~</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">今回は黒多めで作ってみました</span><span class=\"s3\">😶</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">実は</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">まだあと</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\">着ワンショル残ってるんですよ。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">ってことで次のドレミの個握で着ようかなぁ</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span><span class=\"s2\">(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)(</span><span class=\"s1\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s2\">)</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s2\">頂いたお花です</span><span class=\"s4\">❁</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5337.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5059.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">外の光ってすごい。。。。</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">そして子の日は、柿崎芽実さんの卒業の日でもありました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">花束や卒業証書授与などを見て、本当に居なくなってしまうんだと、やっとここで実感したような気がします。</span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5142.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"s1\">ひらがなけやき</span><span class=\"s2\">\" </span><span class=\"s1\">から</span><span class=\"s2\"> \"</span><span class=\"s1\">日向坂</span><span class=\"s2\">46\" </span><span class=\"s1\">の約</span><span class=\"s2\">3</span><span class=\"s1\">年間、本当にお疲れ様でした！！！</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">そして、本当に本当にありがとうございました！</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">「キュン」の握手会が全て終わりましたが、もうすぐで「ドレミソラシド」の握手会が始まります！</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s2\">8</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s2\">17</span><span class=\"s1\">日に京都で開催される全国握手会です！</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">お時間がありましたら、是非会いに来てください</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">待ってますよ</span><span class=\"s2\">~</span><span class=\"s4\">♪♪♪</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\">*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.</span><span class=\"s1\">。</span><span class=\"s2\">*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.</span><span class=\"s1\">。</span><span class=\"s2\">*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.</span><span class=\"s1\">。</span><span class=\"s2\">*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.</span><span class=\"s1\">。</span><span class=\"s2\">*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.*:</span><span class=\"s1\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">.:.</span><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">最近の私の趣味。。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">それは</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">全国高等学校野球選手権大会！</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">通称、甲子園を見ることが楽しみになっています！</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">実を言うと予選から結構見てたんですよね。笑</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">本戦は合計で</span><span class=\"s2\">22</span><span class=\"s1\">試合も見ていたみたいです！(今数えてみました。笑)</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">最初のほうは時間が無くて見れてなかったんですけど、、、途中から追ってきています！！</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">よくファンの皆さんに「そんなに野球(甲子園)好きだったの？？」って聞かれるんですけど</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">甲子園は中学生の時から見てました！</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">ね、ね、知らなかったでしょ？</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">部活で早く帰ってきた時はチャンネル変えて甲子園見てましたね</span><span class=\"s2\">~</span><span class=\"s1\">。。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">唯一の大阪からは「履正社高等学校」が出場していて、</span><span class=\"s2\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">回戦まで勝ち進んでいます！</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">大阪出身からしたら誇りですよ</span><span class=\"s2\">~</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">あの</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">こんな感じですごく楽しんでます。笑笑</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">あと付け足しすると</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">今「</span><span class=\"s2\">MIX</span><span class=\"s1\">」最高に面白くなってきてます。最高です。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">あだち充先生の絵のタッチがとっても好きで野球関連の漫画はほぼ見た事があります(</span><span class=\"s2\"> ¨̮ </span><span class=\"s1\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">実家戻って「クロスゲーム」読みたーーーい</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">「</span><span class=\"s2\">MIX</span><span class=\"s1\">」は東京に来てから集めているのでいつでも読めるんですけどね</span><span class=\"s2\">~</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">漫画もアニメもどっちも面白いから、私にとってはリフレッシュ出来る唯一の時間です</span><span class=\"s3\">☺️</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">こうしてブログに書いてると、実際にファンの皆さんとの会話の幅が広がった！って感じるんです</span><span class=\"s3\">😶</span><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">とっても楽しそうに皆さんが話してくれるから、私も自然と楽しくなって♪</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">ファンの皆さんとも共通の事が出来ると楽しいし、</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">それが仕事に繋がればとっても嬉しいし</span><span class=\"s3\">😊</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">いつか夢が叶いますように。。。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5116.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_7.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5117.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_8.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5133.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_9.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5121.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_10.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5120.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2019-08-15/30514_11.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5140.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">めちゃわろてる小坂でしめます。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">読んでいただきありがとうございます。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s1\">小坂菜緒</span><span class=\"s2\">^._.^</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s2\">#125</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">いつも長いから、今回は手短に。。。</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s2\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><span class=\"s1\">あの</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">誰かキャッチボールしませんか？</span></span></p></div>\n                    ",
